<title>USA: Chrysler sets unchanged quarterly payout.</title>
<headline>Chrysler sets unchanged quarterly payout.</headline>
<dateline>AUBURN HILLS, Mich. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chrysler Corp said Thursday its board of directors declared an unchanged quarterly dividend of $0.35 a share on its common stock, payable October 15 to holders of record September 15.</p>
</text>
